sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Application
    participant R as Saga Runner
    participant D as Stored streams / SQLite
    participant F as Feed API / group cursors
    participant X as Outbox Executor
    participant P as Fake Stripe port

    Note over A,P: COMMAND = request to do work. EVENT = fact that happened. RECORD = persisted envelope.
    A->>A: InitCheckout [COMMAND]
    A->>D: Append CheckoutRequested [DOMAIN EVENT]<br/>checkouts/checkout-42

    R->>F: poll category=checkouts, group=checkout-saga
    F->>D: Read category records after this group's ack cursor
    D-->>F: CheckoutRequested + metadata + source stream
    F-->>R: FeedEntry at position 101 [SAME DOMAIN EVENT]
    Note over D,F: FeedEntry wraps an existing record with its stream address and feed position.<br/>The feed does not create a second business event.

    R->>R: Saga.react returns ReserveStock + MarkPaymentPending [COMMANDS]<br/>and CreatePaymentIntent [EFFECT REQUEST]
    R->>R: Mint stable keys. ReactionFold fills batch builder.
    rect rgb(232, 242, 252)
        R->>D: AtomicStreams.transact(one batch)
        D->>D: inventory-commands/shoe: ReserveStock<br/>[COMMAND payload stored as an event-stream RECORD]
        D->>D: order-commands/order-42: MarkPaymentPending<br/>[COMMAND payload stored as an event-stream RECORD]
        D->>D: saga-outbox/checkout-saga: Record.Intent(key, CreatePaymentIntent)<br/>[OUTBOX RECORD carrying an EFFECT REQUEST]
        D-->>R: All three writes committed
    end
    R->>F: ack source position 101 [PROGRESS, not a business event]
    Note over R,X: Independent consumers: the outbox is readable as soon as the batch commits.<br/>Source acknowledgement is not a prerequisite for executing the effect.

    X->>F: poll category=saga-outbox, group=checkout-saga
    F->>D: Read outbox records after its separate ack cursor
    D-->>F: Record.Intent + metadata + outbox stream
    F-->>X: FeedEntry at position 104 [SAME INTENT RECORD]
    X->>D: Load stored retry / parked outcomes
    D-->>X: No failed attempts or standing park in this happy path
    X->>P: perform(key, CreatePaymentIntent) [EXTERNAL REQUEST]<br/>Key represents the Stripe Idempotency-Key header
    P-->>X: Port returns Ok after fake PaymentIntent creation<br/>status=requires_payment_method. Payment not completed.
    X->>D: Append Record.Done(key) [TECHNICAL OUTCOME EVENT]<br/>saga-outbox/checkout-saga
    X->>F: ack intent position 104
    X->>F: Later poll delivers Record.Done at position 110
    F-->>X: FeedEntry wrapping Done [SAME OUTCOME RECORD]
    X->>F: ack position 110. No external call for Done.

    Note over A,D: Application command handlers may consume ReserveStock / MarkPaymentPending<br/>and append StockReserved / OrderAwaitingPayment [DOMAIN EVENTS].<br/>Those handlers are not run automatically by the Saga Runner.
    Note over A,P: Persisting a COMMAND makes it a stored event record in Epoch's storage vocabulary.<br/>It remains a business COMMAND: ReserveStock is not evidence that stock was reserved.<br/>Done records port completion, not PaymentSucceeded.
